# Supabase CLI scratch. `supabase/.temp/cli-latest` caches the newest published
# CLI version and is rewritten by any `supabase` invocation, so tracking it
# meant every migration or db query dirtied the tree and blocked the next pull
# with "local changes would be overwritten by merge".
supabase/.temp/
